{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8000_place", "source_sha256": "7e86c711772f2b68a2ca64a5b483509a398ffe36fb0088ed2832ae65221a55a9", "ja": "闇の病院", "zh": "黑暗医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8001_p", "source_sha256": "b3669df54033cb59524c40d0b2dfe959ba4c7a9c85cf7061ac2c60fb5b4439d7", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\nひなたは『闇の病院で働くナース』として撮影する）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真特辑。\n日向将以“在黑暗医院工作的护士”为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8002_035hin", "source_sha256": "ffb40f29562d8a7a265fd6a3c22e04a57915c92e17940ce6b53c5a85d4a125af", "ja": "はや～。こったら場所で撮影ができるなんて、\nアイドルってすごいねぇ。", "zh": "好快～。居然能在这种地方拍摄，\n偶像真是厉害呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8003_p", "source_sha256": "38eec9f99b4eb22adebbe8f3550dd00199ba99587270e79f1447e1a3f10a472e", "ja": "そうだろう。今回のテーマは、『闇ナース』……\nちょっとダークな看護師さんだ。", "zh": "没错吧。这次的主题是“暗黑护士”……也就是有点黑暗风格的护士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8004_035hin", "source_sha256": "a200aa92cb493a358f5281131fcb639947119fee807cc54e834bd7180e8324dd", "ja": "面白いことを考える人がいるもんだねぇ。\nでも……あたしにつとまるだろか？", "zh": "真是有人能想到这么有趣的事情呢。不过……我真的能胜任吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8005_p", "source_sha256": "c6e60dfd98465a9ee2900420a9421b85f3fc7c159b19b567976b99cc2ffebba1", "ja": "ひなたの思うがまま、表現すればいいんだ。\nなにも表現の形は一つじゃないからな！", "zh": "按小日向想的去表现就好。\n毕竟，表现的形式可不止一种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8006_035hin", "source_sha256": "f79bcdcd0b8af9a89724dbb9e95b59c441bba83c4063b4dffef9693b1ba390ed", "ja": "ええっ！？　そったらこと言われても……。\nう～ん。……優しい看護師さんじゃないんだよね？", "zh": "诶诶！？就算你这么说……  \n嗯～……不是那种温柔的护士姐姐吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8007_p", "source_sha256": "2737fe807677180013940684198664e79a5813f1f4fb87720a407cc0a80a111b", "ja": "ああ。ちょっと変わった看護師さんだ。\n例えば……。", "zh": "是啊，是个有点特别的护士。\n比如……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8008", "source_sha256": "8e94afc4653133bbfe65da931c838dba0aa9ecfec5a4c17734d7c164741399b7", "ja": "優しすぎるナース", "zh": "过于温柔的护士", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8009", "source_sha256": "33ece3558c3af13cdaa12937aa0873378ae77d5e1418f15ba5ab5f66397bacf4", "ja": "ゾンビナース", "zh": "僵尸护士", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8010", "source_sha256": "78852a3022cab629557a2271e1bfa0ee1866f8aa4a8869bf6942cd4a5e91f5e6", "ja": "泣き虫ナース", "zh": "爱哭鬼护士", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8100_p", "source_sha256": "8e32635f16aadafb849d9401e4251f3f8a7a30a27182bb938eebef7a9c785d3c", "ja": "優しさが大きすぎるとか、どうだ？　患者さんが\n心配過ぎて、勝手に動かないようにしてしまうとかな。", "zh": "比如说，温柔过了头，怎么样？因为太担心患者，结果擅自让患者动不了了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8101_035hin", "source_sha256": "56553f685e42b607030c0b56094c8f1651bf30a5744d4d947e3bace06e64dc62", "ja": "勝手にやってしまうのは、いけないけど。闇の世界は、\nオバケもいるし、普通ではダメなのかもねぇ。", "zh": "擅自做决定是不行的。不过，黑暗世界里还有鬼怪，或许不能按普通的方式来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8102_035hin", "source_sha256": "12ae242bd705913a268be533d0c2f9428f7676031cbc7bd259a8485bd990c610", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとさんです。\nあたし、精一杯、表現してみるよぉ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你啦。\n我会竭尽全力表现出来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8200_p", "source_sha256": "b1616ad9b2b7f16cf5056fc81d00c7b4f680aab3b3c97ae12223bdf03c8531ab", "ja": "ゾンビというのはどうだ？\n闇の世界ならではって感じがしていいと思うんだ。", "zh": "要不试试僵尸？\n我觉得很有黑暗世界特有的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8201_035hin", "source_sha256": "d6c05e74716ee6903a2623792476b1eb3e17dfc95bb9b84bb795d2eb4900b87f", "ja": "看護師さんがゾンビなのかい？　ゾンビっていうと、\nおっかないイメージだけども……。", "zh": "护士小姐是僵尸吗？说到僵尸，总觉得有点可怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8202_035hin", "source_sha256": "76122306717dba12ca90dfd6e9af2ad1a8474e2f3615d8bd30ac7bd777f927de", "ja": "闇の世界だから、ちょうどいいのかもねぇ。\nゾンビの練習してみるから、付き合ってくれるかい？", "zh": "因为是黑暗的世界，说不定正合适呢。要不要陪我练习一下僵尸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8300_p", "source_sha256": "aa08caa32e9e6e89d7f7db2a6d05eb2bd917eda2ad95450293c68f9c4a296b1d", "ja": "親身に患者さんのお世話をしているうちに、\n情が移りすぎて、何かあると号泣するナースさんとか。", "zh": "一边亲切地照料患者，一边情感投入过深，一有什么事就嚎啕大哭的那种护士小姐之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8301_035hin", "source_sha256": "d0bb13cac8f966f88fe87ef1f8f5552eeebb223a6650d9729411597d9eee9db7", "ja": "{$P$}、\n何を言ってるのか、わからないんだわぁ。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n我听不懂你在说什么呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_8303_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a029b76cd9e5e19f3f18f38b7420071c6f0f385711750aeff659f64037c85af", "ja": "闇の世界の看護師さんは、なまら難しいね……。\nちょっとスタッフさんに相談してみるよぉ。", "zh": "黑暗世界的护士，真是太难了……我去找工作人员商量一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
